# ==============================================================================
# Rule Name: TestFlight (Custom)
# Description: Apple TestFlight beta testing platform
# Scope: TestFlight app, beta invitations, and build distribution endpoints
# ==============================================================================

# Target: TestFlight portal and beta application downloads
# Evidence: TestFlight iOS client network trace, 2026-09-28
# Reason: TestFlight requires US/Proxy exit in regions where direct connection fails; isolated from Apple-Direct.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,testflight.apple.com

# Target: Legacy TestFlight beta iTunes API
# Evidence: TestFlight legacy client authentication logs, 2026-09-28
# Reason: Resolves historical beta build testing issues
DOMAIN,beta.itunes.apple.com
